{% comment %}
  Announcement bar — rotating merchant messages with a dismiss control.

  Behaviour notes (task-header.md T-1.1):
  - Dismissal persists in sessionStorage, NOT localStorage: a closed promotional banner
    is a temporary intent, and localStorage would hide the message from returning
    visitors forever even after the merchant changes the copy.
  - 关闭态的判定必须发生在**浏览器首次绘制之前**，否则关闭过的访客每次加载都会
    看到公告栏亮一下再消失（BUG-056）。曾经的假设「defer 脚本在首屏绘制前执行」
    是错的：defer 只保证在 DOMContentLoaded 前跑，浏览器可以先绘制已解析部分。
    现在改为 <aside> 之前的一段内联同步脚本——它执行时 aside 还没解析出来，
    因此改动落在包裹层 .shopify-section 的内联 style 上（见文件内注释）。
    未关闭的访客因此不会看到空条：条子始终照常渲染，只有确实已关闭才不绘制。
  - Multiple messages scroll horizontally. Manual controls (prev/next) always work.
    Auto-rotate is a merchant setting (off by default, per Shopify's accessibility
    guidance). When on, it pauses on hover/focus, stops after the visitor takes over
    manually, and respects prefers-reduced-motion (WCAG 2.2.2 — see the JS).
  - The close button is rendered by Liquid (not built by JS), so it exists in the HTML.
    If the script never loads it would be a dead control, so keep the pairing honest:
    the script is the only thing that makes it work, and the section is still fully
    readable without it.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign has_blocks = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'announcement'
      assign has_blocks = true
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if has_blocks -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    防闪（BUG-056）：必须在浏览器首次绘制前决定这次要不要画公告栏。
    放在 <aside> 之前同步执行 —— 此时 aside 尚未解析，唯一能落状态的地方是
    Shopify 的 section 包裹层 div.shopify-section。
    用 style.display 而不是 hidden 属性：critical.css 里 .shopify-section{display:grid}
    是作者样式，会盖掉 UA 的 [hidden]{display:none}，属性失效但内联样式不会。
    key 与 <aside data-announcement-key> 同源，均由 Liquid 渲染。
    无 JS 时本段不执行、公告栏照常显示（设计如此）；编辑器画布里跳过，
    免得商家自己关过一次就再也看不到它、没法编辑。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.dismissible -%}
    <script>
      (function () {
        var script = document.currentScript;
        if (!script) return;
        /* 编辑器中恒显示，否则商家被自己的 sessionStorage 挡在外面 */
        if (window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode) return;
        var closed = false;
        try {
          closed = window.sessionStorage.getItem('coppice:announcement:closed:{{ section.id }}') === '1';
        } catch (error) {
          closed = false;
        }
        if (!closed) return;
        var host = script.closest('.shopify-section') || script.parentElement;
        if (host) host.style.display = 'none';
      })();
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}

  <aside
    class="announcement-bar full-width"
    role="region"
    aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.label' | t }}"
    data-announcement
    data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
    data-announcement-key="coppice:announcement:closed:{{ section.id }}"
    data-announcement-autoplay="{{ section.settings.autoplay }}"
    data-announcement-interval="{{ section.settings.autoplay_interval }}"
  >
    <div class="announcement-bar__track" data-announcement-track>
      <ul
        class="announcement-bar__list"
        role="list"
        {% if section.blocks.size > 1 %}data-announcement-list{% endif %}
      >
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <li
            class="announcement-bar__item"
            role="listitem"
            {% if forloop.index > 1 %}aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}
          >
            {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
              <a
                class="announcement-bar__link"
                href="{{ block.settings.link }}"
                {% unless forloop.first %}tabindex="-1"{% endunless %}
              >
                {{ block.settings.text }}
              </a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="announcement-bar__text">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} 手动切换：仅多条时出现；自动循环由 JS 控制（见文件头注释） {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="announcement-bar__controls">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="announcement-bar__arrow announcement-bar__arrow--prev"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.previous' | t }}"
          data-announcement-prev
        >
          {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>
        {%- comment -%}
          计数播报：只把"分隔符"交给 JS，数字由 JS 填。
          不用 data-* 传 {{index}} 占位符——t: 过滤器会把它当插值参数，多语言下不可靠。
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p
          class="announcement-bar__count visually-hidden"
          aria-live="polite"
          data-announcement-status
          data-separator="{{ 'general.pagination_separator' | t | escape }}"
        >
          <span data-announcement-current>1</span>{{ 'general.pagination_separator' | t }}<span>{{ section.blocks.size }}</span>
        </p>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="announcement-bar__arrow announcement-bar__arrow--next"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.next' | t }}"
          data-announcement-next
        >
          {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.dismissible -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        由 Liquid 静态渲染，不依赖 JS 构建；无 JS 时脚本会移除它，
        避免留下点了没反应的控件（AGENTS §6：商家未填设置时不留空壳）。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="announcement-bar__close"
        aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.dismiss' | t }}"
        data-announcement-dismiss
      >
        {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
  </aside>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .announcement-bar {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-inline: var(--page-margin);
    /* 设计令牌：品牌色底 + 背景色字，对比度见 T-2.2 验收 */
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .announcement-bar__track {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .announcement-bar__list {
    display: flex;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .announcement-bar__item {
    /* 每条占满 track 一整行宽度，所有项并排留在 flex 流里，
       切换靠 JS 移动整个 list 的 translateX，不能把非当前项
       position:absolute 抽离 flex 流（否则 translateX 移不动）。 */
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* 非当前项只对读屏/交互隐藏，视觉上仍留在流里由 transform 平移控制 */
  .announcement-bar__item[aria-hidden='true'] {
    visibility: hidden;
  }

  .announcement-bar__link,
  .announcement-bar__text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding-block: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* 箭头准则（AGENTS §6）：卡内文字链接不加箭头，这里只给链接态加下划线 */
  .announcement-bar__link:hover,
  .announcement-bar__link:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .announcement-bar__controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow svg {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow--prev svg {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .announcement-bar__close {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    /* 视觉图标可小于点击区 */
    margin-inline-end: -0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .announcement-bar__close svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  /* 焦点态可见（SDD §8.2） */
  .announcement-bar :is(a, button):focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* 已关闭：JS 写入该属性后整条移除 */
  .announcement-bar[data-announcement-closed='true'] {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .announcement-bar__controls {
      display: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

<script src="{{ 'announcement-bar.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.announcement_bar",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "dismissible",
      "label": "t:labels.announcement_dismissible",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "autoplay",
      "label": "t:labels.announcement_autoplay",
      "info": "t:labels.announcement_autoplay_info",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "autoplay_interval",
      "label": "t:labels.announcement_autoplay_interval",
      "info": "t:labels.announcement_autoplay_interval_info",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 15,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "s",
      "default": 5
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "announcement",
      "name": "t:labels.announcement",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "t:labels.text",
          "default": "Free freight on orders over $99"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "t:labels.link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 5,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:general.announcement_bar",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "announcement"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
